{"id":"1255d947cd5af336","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/763_Linear_TGDs.md","title":"763 Linear TGDs","display":"763_Linear_TGDs","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"763-Linear-TGDs\">763 Linear TGDs</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号与原子\">1. 符号与原子</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(N_P,\\operatorname{ar},N_C,N_N)\">\\(\\Sigma=(N_P,\\operatorname{ar},N_C,N_N)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_P\">\\(N_P\\)</span> 是谓词名集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}:N_P\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}:N_P\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_C\">\\(N_C\\)</span> 是常元集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_N=\\{\\nu_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(N_N=\\{\\nu_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span> 是空值集合。变量集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_P,N_C,N_N,\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(N_P,N_C,N_N,\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 两两不交。定义符号 sort 集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sort}_{LTGD}=\\{\\mathsf{pred},\\mathsf{const},\\mathsf{null},\\mathsf{var}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Sort}_{LTGD}=\\{\\mathsf{pred},\\mathsf{const},\\mathsf{null},\\mathsf{var}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 sort 函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sort}_{LTGD}:N_P\\cup N_C\\cup N_N\\cup\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Sort}_{LTGD}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{sort}_{LTGD}:N_P\\cup N_C\\cup N_N\\cup\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Sort}_{LTGD}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sort}_{LTGD}(P)=\\mathsf{pred},\\quad\n\\operatorname{sort}_{LTGD}(c)=\\mathsf{const},\\quad\n\\operatorname{sort}_{LTGD}(\\nu)=\\mathsf{null},\\quad\n\\operatorname{sort}_{LTGD}(x)=\\mathsf{var}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{sort}_{LTGD}(P)=\\mathsf{pred},\\quad\n\\operatorname{sort}_{LTGD}(c)=\\mathsf{const},\\quad\n\\operatorname{sort}_{LTGD}(\\nu)=\\mathsf{null},\\quad\n\\operatorname{sort}_{LTGD}(x)=\\mathsf{var}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in N_P\">\\(P\\in N_P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in N_C\">\\(c\\in N_C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in N_N\">\\(\\nu\\in N_N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>。原始构造子标签为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{head},\\operatorname{ltgd}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{head},\\operatorname{ltgd}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}=N_C\\cup N_N\\cup\\mathsf{Var},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{GTerm}=N_C\\cup N_N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Term}=N_C\\cup N_N\\cup\\mathsf{Var},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{GTerm}=N_C\\cup N_N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原子集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Atom}\">\\(\\mathsf{Atom}\\)</span> 是满足下列条款的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in N_P\">\\(P\\in N_P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(P)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(P)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Term}\">\\(\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Term}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Atom}\">\\(P(\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Atom}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>闭原子集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{GAtom}=\\{P(\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Atom}:\\operatorname{rng}(\\tau)\\subseteq\\mathsf{GTerm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{GAtom}=\\{P(\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Atom}:\\operatorname{rng}(\\tau)\\subseteq\\mathsf{GTerm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(P(\\tau))=\\operatorname{rng}(\\tau)\\cap\\mathsf{Var}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(P(\\tau))=\\operatorname{rng}(\\tau)\\cap\\mathsf{Var}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-Linear-TGD\">2. Linear TGD</h1>\n<p>头部集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Head}=\\mathsf{Atom}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathsf{Head}=\\mathsf{Atom}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>Linear TGD 集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LTGD}=\\{(A,\\eta):A\\in\\mathsf{Atom},\\eta\\in\\mathsf{Head}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{LTGD}=\\{(A,\\eta):A\\in\\mathsf{Atom},\\eta\\in\\mathsf{Head}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对头部和 TGD 定义自由变量：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(H_0,\\ldots,H_{k-1})\n=\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;k}\\operatorname{FV}(H_i),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(H_0,\\ldots,H_{k-1})\n=\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;k}\\operatorname{FV}(H_i),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(A,\\eta)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\eta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(A,\\eta)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\eta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>程序是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi=(\\Sigma,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\Pi=(\\Sigma,\\mathcal L)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{LTGD}\">\\(\\mathcal L\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{LTGD}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-替换与触发\">3. 替换与触发</h1>\n<p>替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Term}\">\\(\\theta:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Term}\\)</span> 的项扩张定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta(c)=c\\ (c\\in N_C),\\quad\n\\widehat\\theta(\\nu)=\\nu\\ (\\nu\\in N_N),\\quad\n\\widehat\\theta(x)=\\theta(x)\\ (x\\in\\mathsf{Var}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\theta(c)=c\\ (c\\in N_C),\\quad\n\\widehat\\theta(\\nu)=\\nu\\ (\\nu\\in N_N),\\quad\n\\widehat\\theta(x)=\\theta(x)\\ (x\\in\\mathsf{Var}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原子替换为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta(P(\\tau))=P(\\tau&#39;)\\quad\\text{其中 }\\tau&#39;(i)=\\widehat\\theta(\\tau(i)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta(P(\\tau))=P(\\tau&#39;)\\quad\\text{其中 }\\tau&#39;(i)=\\widehat\\theta(\\tau(i)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>头部替换为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta(H_0,\\ldots,H_{k-1})=(\\theta(H_0),\\ldots,\\theta(H_{k-1})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta(H_0,\\ldots,H_{k-1})=(\\theta(H_0),\\ldots,\\theta(H_{k-1})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{LTGD}\n=\n\\{(\\widehat\\theta,\\theta_{\\mathsf{Atom}},\\theta_{\\mathsf{Head}}):\\theta:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Term}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{LTGD}\n=\n\\{(\\widehat\\theta,\\theta_{\\mathsf{Atom}},\\theta_{\\mathsf{Head}}):\\theta:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Term}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{\\mathsf{Atom}}(A)=\\theta(A)\">\\(\\theta_{\\mathsf{Atom}}(A)=\\theta(A)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{\\mathsf{Head}}(\\eta)=\\theta(\\eta)\">\\(\\theta_{\\mathsf{Head}}(\\eta)=\\theta(\\eta)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>变量只在 TGD 规则对象中被绑定。定义绑定变量函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{LTGD}:\\mathsf{LTGD}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{LTGD}:\\mathsf{LTGD}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{LTGD}(A,\\eta)=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\eta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{LTGD}(A,\\eta)=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\eta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义存在头变量函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExVar}_{LTGD}(A,\\eta)=\\operatorname{FV}(\\eta)\\setminus\\operatorname{FV}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ExVar}_{LTGD}(A,\\eta)=\\operatorname{FV}(\\eta)\\setminus\\operatorname{FV}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，定义新变量函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshVar}_{LTGD}(X)=x_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshVar}_{LTGD}(X)=x_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 是有限支撑双射，则定义它的项扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\rho:\\mathsf{Term}\\to\\mathsf{Term}\">\\(\\widehat\\rho:\\mathsf{Term}\\to\\mathsf{Term}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\rho(c)=c,\\quad \\widehat\\rho(\\nu)=\\nu,\\quad \\widehat\\rho(x)=\\rho(x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\rho(c)=c,\\quad \\widehat\\rho(\\nu)=\\nu,\\quad \\widehat\\rho(x)=\\rho(x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in N_C\">\\(c\\in N_C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in N_N\">\\(\\nu\\in N_N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>。原子和头部重命名为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho(P(\\tau))=P(\\tau&#39;)\n\\quad\\text{其中}\\quad\n\\tau&#39;(i)=\\widehat\\rho(\\tau(i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho(P(\\tau))=P(\\tau&#39;)\n\\quad\\text{其中}\\quad\n\\tau&#39;(i)=\\widehat\\rho(\\tau(i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho(H_0,\\ldots,H_{k-1})=(\\rho(H_0),\\ldots,\\rho(H_{k-1})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho(H_0,\\ldots,H_{k-1})=(\\rho(H_0),\\ldots,\\rho(H_{k-1})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>TGD 的绑定重命名定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{LTGD}((A,\\eta),\\rho)=(\\rho(A),\\rho(\\eta)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{LTGD}((A,\\eta),\\rho)=(\\rho(A),\\rho(\\eta)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,\\eta)\\equiv_\\alpha^{LTGD}(A&#39;,\\eta&#39;)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,\\eta)\\equiv_\\alpha^{LTGD}(A&#39;,\\eta&#39;)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在有限支撑双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A&#39;,\\eta&#39;)=\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{LTGD}((A,\\eta),\\rho).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A&#39;,\\eta&#39;)=\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{LTGD}((A,\\eta),\\rho).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>触发规则使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,\\eta)\">\\((A,\\eta)\\)</span> 前可先替换为任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价副本；第 4 节的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h^+\">\\(h^+\\)</span> 用新空值替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExVar}_{LTGD}(A,\\eta)\">\\(\\operatorname{ExVar}_{LTGD}(A,\\eta)\\)</span>，因此不会捕获数据库中已有空值。</p>\n<p>对有限闭原子集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GAtom}\">\\(I\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GAtom}\\)</span>，定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Null}(I)=\\{\\nu\\in N_N:\\exists P(\\tau)\\in I\\ \\exists i&lt;\\operatorname{ar}(P)\\ \\tau(i)=\\nu\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Null}(I)=\\{\\nu\\in N_N:\\exists P(\\tau)\\in I\\ \\exists i&lt;\\operatorname{ar}(P)\\ \\tau(i)=\\nu\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>同态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:A\\to I\">\\(h:A\\to I\\)</span> 是函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{GTerm}\">\\(h:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{GTerm}\\)</span>，其对原子的作用由替换条款给出，并满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h(A)\\in I.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h(A)\\in I.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>新空值函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshNull}(X)=\\nu_m\">\\(\\operatorname{freshNull}(X)=\\nu_m\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 是不在有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 中出现的最小下标。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-追逐规则\">4. 追逐规则</h1>\n<p>实例集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Inst}=\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{GAtom})\">\\(\\mathsf{Inst}=\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{GAtom})\\)</span>。对任意初始数据库\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GAtom}\">\\(D\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GAtom}\\)</span>，先定义初始公理集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{LTGD}(D)=D\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{LTGD}(D)=D\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>再固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi=(\\Sigma,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\Pi=(\\Sigma,\\mathcal L)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,\\eta)\\in\\mathcal L\">\\((A,\\eta)\\in\\mathcal L\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:A\\to I\">\\(h:A\\to I\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Z=\\operatorname{FV}(\\eta)\\setminus\\operatorname{FV}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Z=\\operatorname{FV}(\\eta)\\setminus\\operatorname{FV}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 按变量下标升序写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z=\\{z_0,\\ldots,z_{r-1}\\}\">\\(Z=\\{z_0,\\ldots,z_{r-1}\\}\\)</span>。扩展 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h^+:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{GTerm}\">\\(h^+:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{GTerm}\\)</span> 定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h^+(x)=h(x)\\quad(x\\in\\operatorname{FV}(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h^+(x)=h(x)\\quad(x\\in\\operatorname{FV}(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h^+(z_j)=\\operatorname{freshNull}(\\operatorname{Null}(I)\\cup\\{h^+(z_i):i&lt;j\\})\n\\quad(j&lt;r),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h^+(z_j)=\\operatorname{freshNull}(\\operatorname{Null}(I)\\cup\\{h^+(z_i):i&lt;j\\})\n\\quad(j&lt;r),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h^+(y)=h(y)\\quad(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup Z).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h^+(y)=h(y)\\quad(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup Z).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义程序载体和触发对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prog}_{LTGD}\n=\\{(\\Sigma,\\mathcal L):\\mathcal L\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{LTGD}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prog}_{LTGD}\n=\\{(\\Sigma,\\mathcal L):\\mathcal L\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{LTGD}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Trig}_{L}(\\Pi)\n=\\{(I,A,\\eta,h):I\\in\\mathsf{Inst},\\ (A,\\eta)\\in\\mathcal L,\\ h:A\\to I\\}\n\\quad(\\Pi=(\\Sigma,\\mathcal L)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Trig}_{L}(\\Pi)\n=\\{(I,A,\\eta,h):I\\in\\mathsf{Inst},\\ (A,\\eta)\\in\\mathcal L,\\ h:A\\to I\\}\n\\quad(\\Pi=(\\Sigma,\\mathcal L)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{L}(\\Pi)\n=\\{((I),I\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(h^+(\\eta))):(I,A,\\eta,h)\\in\\operatorname{Trig}_{L}(\\Pi)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{L}(\\Pi)\n=\\{((I),I\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(h^+(\\eta))):(I,A,\\eta,h)\\in\\operatorname{Trig}_{L}(\\Pi)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-证明与导出\">5. 证明与导出</h1>\n<p>从数据库 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GAtom}\">\\(D\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GAtom}\\)</span> 出发的 linear chase 证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\">\\(\\rho=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\\)</span>，满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_0=D\">\\(I_0=D\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inst}\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inst}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;i&lt;m\">\\(0&lt;i&lt;m\\)</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{L}(\\Pi)\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{L}(\\Pi)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义证明谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ChaseProof}_{L}(D,\\Pi,\\rho)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ChaseProof}_{L}(D,\\Pi,\\rho)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 是满足上述三条的非空有限序列。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D,\\Pi\\vdash_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}B\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D,\\Pi\\vdash_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}B\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\">\\(\\rho=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ChaseProof}_{L}(D,\\Pi,\\rho)\">\\(\\operatorname{ChaseProof}_{L}(D,\\Pi,\\rho)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in I_{m-1}\">\\(B\\in I_{m-1}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-可达闭包与后承\">6. 可达闭包与后承</h1>\n<p>定义知识库载体：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{KB}_{LTGD}\n=\n\\{(D,\\Pi):D\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GAtom},\\ \\Pi=(\\Sigma,\\mathcal L),\\ \\mathcal L\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{LTGD}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{KB}_{LTGD}\n=\n\\{(D,\\Pi):D\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GAtom},\\ \\Pi=(\\Sigma,\\mathcal L),\\ \\mathcal L\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{LTGD}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 chase 结构集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{LTGD}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Inst}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Str}_{LTGD}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Inst}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Closed}_{L}(D,\\Pi,X)\">\\(\\operatorname{Closed}_{L}(D,\\Pi,X)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{LTGD}\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{LTGD}\\)</span> 且：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in X\">\\(D\\in X\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I),J)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{L}(\\Pi)\">\\(((I),J)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{L}(\\Pi)\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in X\">\\(I\\in X\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\in X\">\\(J\\in X\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义可达闭包：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Reach}_{L}(D,\\Pi)\n=\n\\bigcap\\{X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{LTGD}:\\operatorname{Closed}_{L}(D,\\Pi,X)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Reach}_{L}(D,\\Pi)\n=\n\\bigcap\\{X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{LTGD}:\\operatorname{Closed}_{L}(D,\\Pi,X)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathsf{Inst}\">\\(I\\in\\mathsf{Inst}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathsf{GAtom}\">\\(B\\in\\mathsf{GAtom}\\)</span> 定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I\\models_{LTGD}B\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I\\models_{LTGD}B\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in I\">\\(B\\in I\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>chase 后承定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D,\\Pi\\Vdash_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}B\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D,\\Pi\\Vdash_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}B\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\operatorname{Reach}_{L}(D,\\Pi)\">\\(I\\in\\operatorname{Reach}_{L}(D,\\Pi)\\)</span> 使</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I\\models_{LTGD}B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I\\models_{LTGD}B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-特征差异\">7. 特征差异</h1>\n<p>Linear TGDs 的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{LTGD},\n\\{(A,\\eta):A\\in\\mathsf{Atom},\\ \\eta\\in\\mathsf{Head}\\},\n\\operatorname{Trig}_{L},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{L}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{LTGD},\n\\{(A,\\eta):A\\in\\mathsf{Atom},\\ \\eta\\in\\mathsf{Head}\\},\n\\operatorname{Trig}_{L},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{L}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该对象记录每条 TGD 的体恰为一个原子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，不含多原子体、EGD 或负约束。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S^{0}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}=(\\Sigma,\\operatorname{sort}_{LTGD},\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Term},\\mathsf{GTerm},\\mathsf{Atom},\\mathsf{GAtom},\\mathsf{Head},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BV}_{LTGD},\\operatorname{ExVar}_{LTGD},\\operatorname{freshVar}_{LTGD},\\operatorname{freshNull},\\equiv_\\alpha^{LTGD},\\mathsf{LTGD},\\mathsf{Prog}_{LTGD},\\operatorname{Sub}_{LTGD},\\mathsf{Ax}_{LTGD},\\mathsf{Inst},\\operatorname{Trig}_{L},\\mathsf{Rule}_{L},\\operatorname{ChaseProof}_{L},\\vdash_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\\mathsf{KB}_{LTGD},\\mathsf{Str}_{LTGD},\\operatorname{Reach}_{L},\\models_{LTGD},\\Vdash_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S^{0}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}=(\\Sigma,\\operatorname{sort}_{LTGD},\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Term},\\mathsf{GTerm},\\mathsf{Atom},\\mathsf{GAtom},\\mathsf{Head},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BV}_{LTGD},\\operatorname{ExVar}_{LTGD},\\operatorname{freshVar}_{LTGD},\\operatorname{freshNull},\\equiv_\\alpha^{LTGD},\\mathsf{LTGD},\\mathsf{Prog}_{LTGD},\\operatorname{Sub}_{LTGD},\\mathsf{Ax}_{LTGD},\\mathsf{Inst},\\operatorname{Trig}_{L},\\mathsf{Rule}_{L},\\operatorname{ChaseProof}_{L},\\vdash_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\\mathsf{KB}_{LTGD},\\mathsf{Str}_{LTGD},\\operatorname{Reach}_{L},\\models_{LTGD},\\Vdash_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含 linear TGD chase 推导与可达闭包后承；不含多原子体、EGD、负约束或终止性定理。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-合取查询与-chase-答案证书\">9. 合取查询与 chase 答案证书</h1>\n<p>查询变量集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QVar}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}=\\{z_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{QVar}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}=\\{z_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QVar}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\\cap\\mathsf{GTerm}=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathsf{QVar}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\\cap\\mathsf{GTerm}=\\varnothing\\)</span>；查询变量与常元、空值是不同的对象。</p>\n<p>查询项集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QTerm}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}=\\mathsf{GTerm}\\cup\\mathsf{QVar}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{QTerm}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}=\\mathsf{GTerm}\\cup\\mathsf{QVar}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>查询原子集合显式定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QAt}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\n=\n\\{P(\\tau):P\\in N_P,\\operatorname{ar}(P)=n,\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{QTerm}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{QAt}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\n=\n\\{P(\\tau):P\\in N_P,\\operatorname{ar}(P)=n,\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{QTerm}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>合取查询集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CQ}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\n=\n\\{(\\bar z,\\Phi):k,n\\in\\mathbb N,\\bar z:k\\to\\mathsf{QVar}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\\Phi:n\\to\\mathsf{QAt}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CQ}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\n=\n\\{(\\bar z,\\Phi):k,n\\in\\mathbb N,\\bar z:k\\to\\mathsf{QVar}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\\Phi:n\\to\\mathsf{QAt}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>查询赋值集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QVal}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\n=\n\\{\\nu:\\mathsf{QVar}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\\to\\mathsf{GTerm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{QVal}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\n=\n\\{\\nu:\\mathsf{QVar}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\\to\\mathsf{GTerm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>查询项替换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}:\\mathsf{QTerm}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\\times\\mathsf{QVal}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\\to\\mathsf{GTerm}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}:\\mathsf{QTerm}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\\times\\mathsf{QVal}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\\to\\mathsf{GTerm}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>按下列条款定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}(c,\\nu)=c\n\\quad(c\\in N_C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}(c,\\nu)=c\n\\quad(c\\in N_C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}(\\mu,\\nu)=\\mu\n\\quad(\\mu\\in N_N),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}(\\mu,\\nu)=\\mu\n\\quad(\\mu\\in N_N),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}(z,\\nu)=\\nu(z)\n\\quad(z\\in\\mathsf{QVar}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}(z,\\nu)=\\nu(z)\n\\quad(z\\in\\mathsf{QVar}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>查询原子替换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{qsub}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}:\\mathsf{QAt}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\\times\\mathsf{QVal}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\\to\\mathsf{GAtom}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{qsub}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}:\\mathsf{QAt}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\\times\\mathsf{QVal}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\\to\\mathsf{GAtom}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义为：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=P(\\tau)\">\\(A=P(\\tau)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(P)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(P)=n\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{qsub}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}(A,\\nu)=P(\\tau&#39;)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{qsub}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}(A,\\nu)=P(\\tau&#39;)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau&#39;(i)=\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}(\\tau(i),\\nu)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau&#39;(i)=\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}(\\tau(i),\\nu)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span> 成立。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QCert}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}(D,\\Pi,q,\\nu,\\rho)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{QCert}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}(D,\\Pi,q,\\nu,\\rho)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in\\mathsf{QVal}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\">\\(\\nu\\in\\mathsf{QVal}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ChaseProof}_{L}(D,\\Pi,\\rho)\">\\(\\operatorname{ChaseProof}_{L}(D,\\Pi,\\rho)\\)</span>，且若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\">\\(\\rho=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=(\\bar z,\\Phi)\">\\(q=(\\bar z,\\Phi)\\)</span>，则对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{qsub}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}(\\Phi(i),\\nu)\\in I_{m-1}\">\\(\\operatorname{qsub}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}(\\Phi(i),\\nu)\\in I_{m-1}\\)</span>。查询答案为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in\\operatorname{Ans}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}(D,\\Pi,q)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\rho\\ \\operatorname{QCert}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}(D,\\Pi,q,\\nu,\\rho).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu\\in\\operatorname{Ans}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}(D,\\Pi,q)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\rho\\ \\operatorname{QCert}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}(D,\\Pi,q,\\nu,\\rho).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-整个形式系统\">10. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\n=\n(\\mathcal S^{0}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\\mathsf{QVar}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\\mathsf{QTerm}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\n\\mathsf{QAt}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\\mathsf{CQ}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\\mathsf{QVal}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\n\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\\operatorname{qsub}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\n\\operatorname{QCert}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\\operatorname{Ans}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}\n=\n(\\mathcal S^{0}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\\mathsf{QVar}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\\mathsf{QTerm}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\n\\mathsf{QAt}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\\mathsf{CQ}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\\mathsf{QVal}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\n\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\\operatorname{qsub}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\n\\operatorname{QCert}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}},\\operatorname{Ans}_{\\operatorname{LTGD}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含 linear TGD 的合取查询、chase 答案证书和查询答案关系；不含多原子体、EGD、负约束或终止性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"763-Linear-TGDs","text":"763 Linear TGDs","level":1},{"id":"1.-符号与原子","text":"1. 符号与原子","level":1},{"id":"2.-Linear-TGD","text":"2. Linear TGD","level":1},{"id":"3.-替换与触发","text":"3. 替换与触发","level":1},{"id":"4.-追逐规则","text":"4. 追逐规则","level":1},{"id":"5.-证明与导出","text":"5. 证明与导出","level":1},{"id":"6.-可达闭包与后承","text":"6. 可达闭包与后承","level":1},{"id":"7.-特征差异","text":"7. 特征差异","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1},{"id":"9.-合取查询与-chase-答案证书","text":"9. 合取查询与 chase 答案证书","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个形式系统","text":"10. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(N_P,\\operatorname{ar},N_C,N_N)","display":false},{"tex":"N_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}:N_P\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"N_C","display":false},{"tex":"N_N=\\{\\nu_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"N_P,N_C,N_N,\\mathsf{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Sort}_{LTGD}=\\{\\mathsf{pred},\\mathsf{const},\\mathsf{null},\\mathsf{var}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sort}_{LTGD}:N_P\\cup N_C\\cup N_N\\cup\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Sort}_{LTG